+      (nestedPoleInclusion H1 H2 hsub T e)
+    change u e.1 = ∫ p, exitProbePhysical f p ∂stripGreen hH hLE hlam hLam A H2 T
+      (nestedPoleInclusion H1 H2 hsub T e) at hr
+    rw [← hr]
