+/-- `Ω` has a uniform exterior cone with strictly positive angular opening. -/
+def HasUniformNondegenerateExteriorCone {n : ℕ}
+    (Ω : Set (PDE.Vec n)) : Prop :=
+  ∃ ρ θ : ℝ, 0 < ρ ∧ 0 < θ ∧ θ < 1 ∧
