+      ((contDiff_mollifiedProfile h n).contDiffAt.of_le (by simp)) i k]
+    exact (abs_flatSecond_le _ _ _ _ alpha r M P hr hM (hv i) (hv k) (hh i k)
+      hP.le (hp _)).trans hDC
+
