-    exact hop (kineticVelocityShift h p) hp
-  · intro p hp
-    exact ht (kineticVelocityShift h p) hp
-  · intro p hp
-    exact hl (kineticVelocityShift h p) hp
-
-end HypoellipticAleksandrov.KineticAleksandrov
