-  (ENNReal.ofReal A * (∫⁻ T in Ioi (0 : ℝ), ENNReal.ofReal
-    (T ^ (δ - 1) * Real.exp (-k * T))) *
-      (ENNReal.ofReal (Real.log 2))⁻¹) ^ (1 / q)
