+/-- The Fourier transform of `g(y) • κ y` is the fibre representative `k̃^ξ(y)`. -/
+lemma vecFourier_smul_kernel (κ : Kernel Y (PDE.Vec d)) (g : Y → ℝ≥0∞) (y : Y)
