-    ParabolicMemLpOn V 2 (properDiffusionGradientSum q D beta j) ∧
-    ParabolicMemLpOn V 2 (properDiffusionDerivedCoefficientSum q D beta j i) ∧
-    ParabolicMemLpOn V 2 (properDiffusionHessianSum q D beta j i) ∧
