-    |∫ z, R z * spatialDifferenceQuotient k (-h) psi z| ≤
-        ‖hR.toLp R‖ * (2 * Keta * ‖hqh.toLp qh‖ +
-          Real.sqrt (∫ z in V, w z * Hk z ^ 2)) := hsource
